1
00:00:00,665 --> 00:00:01,975
(Penny:)No, I'm dry.

2
00:00:02,133 --> 00:00:03,973
(Penny:)You're a big crybaby.
You start, I'll join in.

3
00:00:05,236 --> 00:00:07,016
(Leonard:)I am not a crybaby.

4
00:00:07,171 --> 00:00:08,271
(Penny:)Toy Story 3?

5
00:00:08,439 --> 00:00:11,579
(Leonard:)The toys were holding hands
in a furnace!

6
00:00:16,781 --> 00:00:19,281
(Leonard:)Look, Arthur lived a full life.

7
00:00:20,518 --> 00:00:22,468
(Leonard:)And he inspired a lot of people.

8
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:26,360
Sure, he was
my childhood hero, but...

9
00:00:26,524 --> 00:00:29,134
(Leonard:)...the fact that I got
to work with him,

10
00:00:29,293 --> 00:00:31,963
(Leonard:)side by side, before he...

11
00:00:32,129 --> 00:00:34,769
(Leonard:)...died was...

12
00:00:35,766 --> 00:00:38,006
(Leonard:)It was a gift.

13
00:00:38,135 --> 00:00:40,045
(Leonard:)It was a gift.

14
00:00:41,372 --> 00:00:45,012
(Penny:)Thank you for being the emotional one
in this relationship.

15
00:00:46,677 --> 00:00:49,887
(Leonard:)-I got your back.
-Yeah.

16
00:00:51,315 --> 00:00:53,295
OK, here we go.

17
00:00:53,451 --> 00:00:56,231
The Phantom Menace.

18
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:58,230
(Raj:)Let's get this over with.

